{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12092","headline":"送崔十三东游 · 钱起","name":"送崔十三东游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里有同心，十年一会面。\n当杯缓筝柱，倏忽催离宴。\n丹凤城头噪晚鸦，行人马首夕阳斜。\n灞上春风留别袂，关东新月宿谁家。\n官柳依依两乡色，谁能此别不相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}